      "content": "wait, what? i'm just asking for technical debugging steps for an automotive system. i don't need metaphors about goblins or mines of Moria. \n\ncan you just stick to the actual technical advice? you mentioned valgrind, but i already said i can't run heavy profiling tools on the hardware itself due to resource constraints. what are some lightweight ways to monitor this in an embedded environment where i can't just install standard linux tools?",
